pan class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£16</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Japanese whisky stirred with hojicha vermouth, bitter orange and cacao.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000002"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Yuzu Highball</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£13</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Japanese whisky, fresh yuzu and hard-carbonated soda.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000003"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Shiso Gimlet</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£14</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>London dry gin, shiso leaf cordial and lime.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000004"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Umeshu Sour</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£14</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Plum wine, rice shochu, lemon and a silky egg-white foam.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000005"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Sakura Spritz</span><span class="ms-badge">New</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£13</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Junmai sake, cherry blossom cordial, sparkling wine and soda.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000006"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Kuro Negroni</span><span class="ms-badge">Signature</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£15</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Gin, black sesame Campari and sweet vermouth, stirred over a clear block.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000007"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Matcha Colada</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£14</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>White rum, ceremonial matcha, coconut and pineapple.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000008"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Sencha Martini</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£15</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Vodka and sencha-infused dry vermouth, very cold.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000009"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Kinmokusei Fizz</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£13</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Gin, osmanthus blossom, lemon and soda.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000010"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Ginger Mule</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£13</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Barley shochu, fresh ginger, lime and ginger beer.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000011"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Hojicha Espresso Martini</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£15</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Vodka, roasted hojicha, coffee liqueur and cold brew.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000012"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Plum Blossom Royale</span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£16</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Umeshu topped with sparkling sake.</span></p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="ms-block ms-block--section ms-emphasis--normal" data-ms-block="blk_sn000003"><section class="ms-section ms-section--card"><div class="ms-section__heading"><h2 class="ms-section__title"><span>Zero Proof</span></h2></div><div class="ms-cards"><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000013"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Yuzu Tonic</span><span class="ms-marks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Vegan" class="ms-mark ms-mark--vegan"><title>Vegan</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M4 20 C4 10 10 4 20 4 C20 13 14.5 20 4 20 Z M4 20 L14 10" fill="none" stroke="#1B7F3B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g></svg></span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£8</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Yuzu, sansho pepper and Indian tonic.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000014"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Hojicha Cold Brew Soda</span><span class="ms-marks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Vegan" class="ms-mark ms-mark--vegan"><title>Vegan</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M4 20 C4 10 10 4 20 4 C20 13 14.5 20 4 20 Z M4 20 L14 10" fill="none" stroke="#1B7F3B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g></svg></span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">£8</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Roasted green tea cold brew, demerara and soda.</span></p></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></section><section class="ms-page" data-ms-page="pg_sn000002" data-ms-page-index="1" style="width:216mm;height:303mm"><div class="ms-page__bg" style="left:0mm;top:0mm;width:216mm;height:303mm"></div><div class="ms-page__trim" style="left:3mm;top:3mm;width:210mm;height:297mm"><div class="ms-page__content" data-ms-content="true" style="left:9mm;right:9mm;top:9mm;height:279mm"><div class="ms-block ms-block--section ms-emphasis--normal" data-ms-block="blk_sn000004"><section class="ms-section ms-section--card"><div class="ms-section__heading"><h2 class="ms-section__title"><span>Small Plates</span></h2><p class="ms-section__availability">Tue–Sun · 18:00–23:00</p></div><div class="ms-cards"><div class="ms-item ms-item--card" data-ms-item="itm_ya000015"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Edamame</span><span class="ms-marks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Vegan" class="ms-mark ms-mark--vegan"><title>Vegan</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M4 20 C4 10 10 4 20 4 C20 13 14.5 20 4 20 Z M4 20 L14 10" fill="none" stroke="#1B7F3B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Gluten free" class="ms-mark ms-mark--gluten_free"><title>Gluten free</title><g transform="translat