spicy_1"><title>Mildly spicy</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M14.5 5.5 C17 6.7 18 9 17.4 12 C16.3 17 11 20.5 5 20 C8 18.4 11 15.2 12 11 C12.6 8.3 13 6.2 14.5 5.5 Z M14.5 5.5 C14.5 4 15.5 3 17 3" fill="#A3261C" stroke="none"></path></g></svg></span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">₹240</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Three eggs, green chilli, onion, coriander, toasted pav.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--compact" data-ms-item="itm_fb000011"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Shakshuka</span><span class="ms-marks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Contains egg" class="ms-mark ms-mark--egg"><title>Contains egg</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><rect x="1.5" y="1.5" width="21" height="21" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#B7791F" stroke-width="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.5" fill="#B7791F"></circle></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 38 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1.5833333333333333)" role="img" aria-label="Spicy" class="ms-mark ms-mark--spicy_2"><title>Spicy</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M14.5 5.5 C17 6.7 18 9 17.4 12 C16.3 17 11 20.5 5 20 C8 18.4 11 15.2 12 11 C12.6 8.3 13 6.2 14.5 5.5 Z M14.5 5.5 C14.5 4 15.5 3 17 3" fill="#A3261C" stroke="none"></path></g><g transform="translate(14 0)"><path d="M14.5 5.5 C17 6.7 18 9 17.4 12 C16.3 17 11 20.5 5 20 C8 18.4 11 15.2 12 11 C12.6 8.3 13 6.2 14.5 5.5 Z M14.5 5.5 C14.5 4 15.5 3 17 3" fill="#A3261C" stroke="none"></path></g></svg></span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">₹320</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Eggs baked in spiced tomato with sourdough.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--compact" data-ms-item="itm_fb000012"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Avocado Toast</span><span class="ms-marks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Vegetarian" class="ms-mark ms-mark--veg"><title>Vegetarian</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><rect x="1.5" y="1.5" width="21" height="21" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#1B7F3B" stroke-width="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.5" fill="#1B7F3B"></circle></g></svg></span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price ms-price--variants "><span class="ms-price__variant"><span class="ms-price__label">Classic</span><span class="ms-price__amount">₹340</span></span><span class="ms-price__variant"><span class="ms-price__label">With poached egg</span><span class="ms-price__amount">₹390</span></span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Sourdough, smashed avocado, pickled onion and chilli oil.</span></p></div></div><div class="ms-item ms-item--compact" data-ms-item="itm_fb000013"><div class="ms-item__body"><div class="ms-item__head"><span class="ms-item__name">Ragi Banana Pancakes</span><span class="ms-marks"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="0.95em" width="calc(0.95em * 1)" role="img" aria-label="Vegetarian" class="ms-mark ms-mark--veg"><title>Vegetarian</title><g transform="translate(0 0)"><rect x="1.5" y="1.5" width="21" height="21" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#1B7F3B" stroke-width="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.5" fill="#1B7F3B"></circle></g></svg></span><span class="ms-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ms-price "><span class="ms-price__amount">₹290</span></span></div><p class="ms-item__desc"><span>Finger millet pancakes, jaggery syrup and whipped curd.</span></p></div></div></div></div></li><li class="ms-journey__step"><div class="ms-journey__marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>4</span></div><div class="ms-journey__body"><h2 class="ms-section__title">Bakery</h2><div class="ms-items"><div class="ms-item ms-item--compact" data-ms-item="itm_fb000014"><div class="ms-